ake sure your PR title includes a [conventional commit](https://o3-docs.openmrs.org/docs/frontend-modules/contributing.en-US#contributing-guidelines) label. See existing PR titles for inspiration.\n- [ ] My work is based on designs, which are linked or shown either in the Jira ticket or the description below. (See also: [Styleguide](http://om.rs/o3ui))\n- [x] My work includes tests or is validated by existing tests.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds the bill discounts feature to the billing app: cashiers can request percentage or fixed-amount discounts on a whole bill or individual line items, and admins can approve or reject pending requests from a dedicated dashboard. Approved discounts reduce the bill's net amount due and feed through to payment settlement; rejected requests leave the bill total unchanged.\n\nIncludes:\n- Request-discount modal with client-side validation (percentage cap at 100%, fixed amount can't exceed the line/bill total or push the amount due negative on partially-paid bills).\n- Admin \"Discount requests\" page and review modal with approve/reject flows.\n- Invoice page integration: discount/net amount trio, request-discount entry points hidden on PAID/ADJUSTED bills and per-line-item when an existing discount targets the line.\n\n## Screenshots\n\n<!-- Required if you are making UI changes. -->\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/edce149e-447b-4000-8f04-676e8d99f8d2\n\n## Related Issue\n\n<!-- Paste the link to the Jira ticket here if one exists. -->\nhttps://issues.openmrs.org/browse/O3-5417\n\n## Other\n\n<!-- Anything not covered above —>\nThis also cleans up the previous bill waiver functionality that we had, because the discount feature was meant to replace it.\n\n### Backend dependency: BillDiscount purge\n\nThe e2e spec for the discount workflow (`e2e/specs/bill-discounts.spec.ts`) is **skipped** in this PR. The backend's `BillDiscountResource.purge` currently throws `UnsupportedOperationException`, and the `bill_discount` FK on `cashier_bill_line_item` has no `ON DELETE CASCADE`, so once a bill has a discount the e2e cleanup can't purge it — the test patient and bill leak between runs. The discount-purging helper in `e2e/commands/billing-operations.ts` is commented out for the same reason.\n\nA follow-up PR on `openmrs-module-billing` will add purge support for `BillDiscount` (or cascade the purge from `Bill`). Once that ships, un-skip the spec and uncomment `purgeBillDiscounts` in `deleteBill`.","freshness":[{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","lastSyncedAt":"2026-10-24T04:03:04.465Z","stale":false}],"nextOffset":null,"truncated":[]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"427c3652-9b5b-4324-9547-c04f7d6b0a99","uuid":"8a794075-bc11-40ad-8801-75e1e5686ffc","timestamp":"2026-10-24T04:25:23.135Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","number":732,"kind":"pr","title":"(feat) O3-5417: Add bill discounts feature","state":"merged","author":"NethmiRodrigo","createdAt":"2026-05-15T11:36:32.000Z","mergedAt":"2026-05-18T16:52:26.000Z","closedAt":"2026-05-18T16:52:26.000Z","url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app/pull/732","mergeCommit":"5127b0c031addf584cc49f6252272121d50c5cad","syncedAt":"2026-10-24T04:03:04.465Z","tickets":[{"key":"O3-5417","source":"ticket-pattern"}],"commits":[{"sha":"5127b0c031addf584cc49f6252272121d50c5cad","source":"merge-commit-sha","verified":true}],"files":[{"path":"e2e/commands/billing-operations.ts","additions":21,"deletions":0},{"path":"e2e/pages/discounts-page.ts","additions":75,"deletions":0},{"path":"e2e/pages/index.ts","additions":1,"deletions":0},{"path":"e2e/pages/invoice-page.ts","additions":6,"deletions":6},{"path":"e2e/specs/bill-discounts.spec.ts","additions":262,"deletions":0},{"path":"src/billable-services/bill-waiver/bill-selection.component.tsx","additions":0,"deletions":76},{"path":"src/billable-services/bill-waiver/bill-waiver-form.component.tsx","additions":0,"de