ng UI changes. -->\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/edce149e-447b-4000-8f04-676e8d99f8d2\n\n## Related Issue\n\n<!-- Paste the link to the Jira ticket here if one exists. -->\nhttps://issues.openmrs.org/browse/O3-5417\n\n## Other\n\n<!-- Anything not covered above —>\nThis also cleans up the previous bill waiver functionality that we had, because the discount feature was meant to replace it.\n\n### Backend dependency: BillDiscount purge\n\nThe e2e spec for the discount workflow (`e2e/specs/bill-discounts.spec.ts`) is **skipped** in this PR. The backend's `BillDiscountResource.purge` currently throws `UnsupportedOperationException`, and the `bill_discount` FK on `cashier_bill_line_item` has no `ON DELETE CASCADE`, so once a bill has a discount the e2e cleanup can't purge it — the test patient and bill leak between runs. The discount-purging helper in `e2e/commands/billing-operations.ts` is commented out for the same reason.\n\nA follow-up PR on `openmrs-module-billing` will add purge support for `BillDiscount` (or cascade the purge from `Bill`). Once that ships, un-skip the spec and uncomment `purgeBillDiscounts` in `deleteBill`.","freshness":[{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-billing-app","lastSyncedAt":"2026-10-24T04:03:04.465Z","stale":false}],"nextOffset":null,"truncated":[]}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Btm9ZKdYFzmhWpcWJKmvN2","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
